  "notes": "USAGE:\n- {辛勝|しんしょう}する (to win narrowly)\n- {辛|から}くも{勝|か}つ (to barely win - related expression)\n{辛|しん} here means \"difficult\" or \"painful\" (same kanji as {辛|から}い/spicy, {辛|つら}い/hard). The victory was not easy and may have come down to the wire.\n\nVICTORY SCALE (by margin/effort):\n- {圧勝|あっしょう} (overwhelming victory)\n- {大勝|たいしょう} (big win)\n- {快勝|かいしょう} (easy win)\n- {辛勝|しんしょう} (narrow win)\n\nDEFEAT COUNTERPART:\n- {惜敗|せきはい} (narrow defeat) - when you lose by a small margin\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {接戦|せっせん} (close game)\n- {僅差|きんさ} (slight difference)",
